  concept: 'Authored objective: Route 132 traces and plate 38 vias.

    Authored
    requirement: Verify all native route pairs, 38 plated spans, seven continuity
    domains and W133.

    General teaching principle: PCB acceptance depends on
    the authored footprints, nets, layers, clearances and route constraints; visual
    appearance alone is insufficient.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A multilayer road map helps visualize routing, but electrical continuity
    and constraints still require checks.
